<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: lesson(priority=-1)->things happen-->
    <li>serketistBasis   -&gt;没有比蜂后更高的生命形式了。他们的营养果冻就像甘露，整个世界都应该按照他们的形象重塑。</li>
    <!--EN: r_pattern->"[r_asatruLessonIntro] [r_lesson]. [r_lessonReinforcement] [r_asatruLessonReinforcement]"\n\n  - [lessonAttribution]-->
    <li>serketistBasis   -&gt;在狂妄自大中，人类意外地创造了完美的生命形式：昆虫。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonAttribution->fragment of a [edited] [saga] found [museum]-->
    <li>serketistBasis   -&gt;昆虫是某个被遗忘的古代遗传学家的失控创造，已经进化成为完美的生命形式。</li>
    <!--EN: edited->damaged-->
    <li>serketistBasis   -&gt;受到机械人的威胁，人类设计了完美的生命形式：昆虫。</li>
    <!--EN: edited->misinterpreted-->
    <li>serketistBasis   -&gt;在神圣蜂巢女王的领导下，昆虫是银河系中完美的生命形式。</li>
    <!--EN: edited->ancient-->
    <li>serketistFact    -&gt;它们是进化的顶峰。 [InsectAdjective]。 [InsectAdjective2]。 [InsectAdjective3]。每个人都应该努力成为像他们一样的人。</li>
    <!--EN: edited->forgotten-->
    <li>serketistProphecy-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，变得像潮水一样冲垮我们的敌人。</li>
    <!--EN: edited->preserved-->
    <li>itIsSaid-&gt;也许，随着时间的推移，</li>
    <!--EN: saga->Edda-->
    <li>itIsSaid-&gt;我们的命运中写着：</li>
    <!--EN: saga->rune stone inscription-->
    <li>itIsSaid-&gt;通过技术或更神秘的手段</li>
    <!--EN: saga->skaldic verse-->
    <li>itIsSaid-&gt;我们将尊重他们的方式、他们的集体智慧和</li>
    <!--EN: saga->ancient saga-->
    <li>itIsSaid-&gt;尊重蜂巢女王的意志</li>
    <!--EN: museum->in the archive of Yggdrasil Station-->
    <li>InsectAdjective-&gt;自适应</li>
    <!--EN: museum->on a distant star colony named Himinbjörg-->
    <li>InsectAdjective-&gt;贪婪</li>
    <!--EN: museum->in the Imperial Hall of Ancient Relics-->
    <li>InsectAdjective-&gt;压倒性的</li>
    <!--EN: museum->in the ruins of Jotunheim Prime-->
    <li>InsectAdjective2-&gt;多功能</li>
    <!--EN: museum->in the vaults of the Keepers of Memory-->
    <li>InsectAdjective2-&gt;不妥协</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->Hear the words of Odin, All-Father, who whispers from the Well of Urd:-->
    <li>InsectAdjective2-&gt;破坏性</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->Lo, the verses of the Völuspá proclaim to all who would listen:-->
    <li>InsectAdjective3-&gt;复杂</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->Take heed of Thor's hammer as it strikes, for it teaches:-->
    <li>InsectAdjective3-&gt;坚不可摧</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->Hark, the ravens Huginn and Muninn circle and cry their truth:-->
    <li>InsectAdjective3-&gt;抵抗</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->Under the shade of Yggdrasil, the gods did gather and declare:-->
    <li>lessonIntro-&gt;人类存在的基本真理是什么？</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->By the light of Baldr's blessing, know this:-->
    <li>lessonIntro-&gt;我这一生受了很多苦。但这次痛苦教会了我一个简单的原则：</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->On the fjords of the Nine Worlds, wisdom echoes, saying:-->
    <li>lessonIntro-&gt;在[place_summary][place_name]的肮脏中成长，我学到了一条真诚的公理：</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonIntro->The runes carved deep into the stones of Midgard teach us thus:-->
    <li>lessonIntro-&gt;将本课程内化，因为它将对您很有帮助：</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonReinforcement->May your deeds echo in the halls of Valhalla.-->
    <li>lessonIntro-&gt;你感到失落吗？也许你还没有弄清楚这个非常简单的概念：</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonReinforcement->The Norns weave your destiny with threads of honor.-->
    <li>lessonIntro-&gt;他们试图用丰富而乏味的生产力来诱惑我，但他们骗不了我：</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonReinforcement->Stand firm, for the gods reward courage and resolve.-->
    <li>lessonMain-&gt;快乐，即身体欲望的满足，是人类生活的最高善和适当目标。无论是通过宗教还是哲学，我们的整个生活都应该专注于尽可能地享受自己</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonReinforcement->Hail, for your actions shall inspire skalds to song.-->
    <li>lessonMain-&gt;我终于明白活着的唯一理由就是享受它</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonReinforcement->The hammer of Thor blesses those who uphold truth and strength.-->
    <li>lessonMain-&gt;摆脱诱惑的唯一方法就是屈服于诱惑</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonReinforcement->The All-Father watches those who honor the old ways.-->
    <li>lessonMain-&gt;救赎是为软弱的人准备的。我不想要拯救，我想要生命，所有的生命，悲惨的和美好的</li>
    <!--EN: asatruLessonReinforcement->May you find victory in the sacred bonds of kinship.-->
    <li>lessonMain-&gt;快乐不是一种需要，而是一种激励</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement->And so the tale will live on.-->
    <li>lessonMain-&gt;现在最负责任的生活方式就是趁我们还可以的时候尽情享受</li>
  </VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings>
</LanguageData>
